  "prefLabel": "Rev 2201.18 Uniform chart of accounts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2201.18 \"Uniform chart of accounts\" means the account titles, descriptions, and numbering classification system expressed in this chapter established by the department in accordance with RSA 21-J:13, III.\n\nSource. #6808, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8687, eff 7-21-06; ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14 (from Rev 2201.14); ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24 (formerly Rev 2201.17)",
